msgid "# Quick Start"
msgstr "# 快速开始"

msgid ""
"This guide uses Qwen3-0.6B as an example to help you run your first offline "
"inference workload or deploy an online service on a prepared Ascend host "
"using a prebuilt vLLM Ascend container."
msgstr ""
"本指南以 Qwen3-0.6B 为例，帮助您在准备好的 Ascend 主机上，使用预构建的 vLLM Ascend "
"容器运行您的第一个离线推理任务或部署在线服务。"

msgid "## Requirements {: #quick-start-requirements }"
msgstr "## 环境要求 {: #quick-start-requirements }"

msgid ""
"- Operating system: Linux\n"
"- Python: {{ release_python_version }}\n"
"- Docker\n"
"- Supported hardware:"
msgstr ""
"- 操作系统：Linux\n"
"- Python：{{ release_python_version }}\n"
"- Docker\n"
"- 支持的硬件："

msgid "{% include \"getting_started/installation/supported_hardware.inc.md\" %}"
msgstr "{% include \"getting_started/installation/supported_hardware.inc.md\" %}"

msgid "??? note \"Software stack included in the vLLM Ascend image\""
msgstr "??? note \"vLLM Ascend 镜像中包含的软件栈\""

msgid ""
"The prebuilt image includes a validated Python and Ascend user-space "
"software stack, including CANN, NNAL, PyTorch, TorchNPU, vLLM, and vLLM "
"Ascend."
msgstr ""
"预构建镜像包含经过验证的 Python 和 Ascend 用户态软件栈，包括 CANN、NNAL、PyTorch、TorchNPU、vLLM 和 "
"vLLM Ascend。"

msgid ""
"A2, A3, and 950DT images also include the matching Triton Ascend runtime. "
"Atlas 300I DUO and Atlas 200I Pro do not use Triton Ascend."
msgstr ""
"A2、A3 和 950DT 镜像还包含匹配的 Triton Ascend 运行时。Atlas 300I DUO 和 Atlas 200I Pro 不使用"
" Triton Ascend。"

msgid ""
"For the exact validated versions, see [Installation Guide > Hardware and "
"software stack](installation.md#installation-hardware-software-stack)."
msgstr ""
"有关确切的已验证版本，请参阅[安装指南 > 硬件和软件栈](installation.md#installation-hardware-"
"software-stack)。"

msgid "## Installation {: #quick-start-installation }"
msgstr "## 安装 {: #quick-start-installation }"

msgid ""
"Before using containers, make sure Docker is installed on your system. If "
"Docker is not installed, please refer to the [Docker installation "
"guide](https://docs.docker.com/get-started/get-docker/) for installation "
"instructions."
msgstr ""
"在使用容器之前，请确保您的系统已安装 Docker。如果尚未安装 Docker，请参阅 [Docker "
"安装指南](https://docs.docker.com/get-started/get-docker/) 获取安装说明。"

